# Test Agent Pack Output

## When to Use
After updating agent pack content, skills, hooks, or the CLI builder. Invoke by asking: "test agent pack" or "verify agent pack output".

## Steps

### 1. Build the CLI
```bash
cd packages/cli && npx tsup src/index.ts --format esm --dts
```

### 2. Scaffold Test Projects
```bash
cd /tmp
node <project-root>/packages/cli/dist/index.js test-claude-app -a claude -m "hyperdb,qvac" --no-install
node <project-root>/packages/cli/dist/index.js test-cursor-app -a cursor -m "hyperdb,qvac" --no-install
node <project-root>/packages/cli/dist/index.js test-opencode-app -a opencode -m "hyperdb,qvac" --no-install
```

### 3. Verify Claude Output
- [ ] `CLAUDE.md` exists and ≤8KB
- [ ] `.claude/settings.json` valid JSON with hooks + permissions
- [ ] `.claude/skills/` has SKILL.md files with valid frontmatter
- [ ] Skills with `resources/` have those files present

### 4. Verify Cursor Output
- [ ] `.cursor/rules/project.mdc` has `alwaysApply: true`
- [ ] `.cursorignore` exists
- [ ] All `.mdc` files have valid `---` frontmatter
- [ ] Glob-scoped rules have valid `globs` arrays

### 5. Verify OpenCode Output
- [ ] `opencode.json` valid JSON
- [ ] `.opencode/instructions.md` exists and ≤8KB
- [ ] `.opencode/skills/` has SKILL.md files
- [ ] Skill gating has `"*": false` default

### 6. Sync to CLI
```bash
cp -r packages/agent-pack/src/* packages/cli/agent-pack-src/
```

### 7. Clean Up
```bash
rm -rf /tmp/test-claude-app /tmp/test-cursor-app /tmp/test-opencode-app
```
